    "summary": "Use it in either player's Fight phase, right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA KHORNE** unit of yours targeted by any of those attacks. Until the phase ends, each time a melee attack destroys 1 of its models that hasn't fought yet this phase, roll a D6. On a 4+:\n\n- leave the model on the battlefield for now\n- after the attacker's attacks are all resolved, the model can fight\n- then remove it from play",
